     "state": "answered"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "a_lachavero_itmar",
     "gloss_en": "ההוא לחבירו אתמר -- Rav Nachman spoke of a bronchus perforated into its fellow (= p_lachavero_itmar)",
